# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md
# Refreshes after you push; the language bar can take a few minutes to update.

# C# application source — keep in language statistics
*.cs linguist-detectable=true

# Small MSBuild/XML project files — don’t show as a separate “XML” slice
*.csproj linguist-generated
*.props linguist-generated
*.targets linguist-generated

# Notebooks are JSON with huge embedded outputs (plots, base64). They dominate bytes
# and hide Python/C#. Mark as generated so the bar reflects .py and .cs fairly.
# Delete this line if you prefer Jupyter to appear in the language breakdown.
*.ipynb linguist-generated

# Markdown is documentation, not program code
*.md linguist-documentation
